---
import "../../styles/admin.css";
import { ADMIN_NAV_CSS, getAdminNavHtml } from "../../lib/admin-nav";

const adminNav = getAdminNavHtml("maintenance");
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Maintenance — Admin ManabuPlay</title>
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
  <style>
    .maint-shell { min-height:100vh; background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 45% at 50% -10%,rgba(139,92,246,.22) 0%,transparent 70%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse 40% 40% at 90% 15%,rgba(34,211,238,.14) 0%,transparent 60%),
      #0a0911; }
    .maint-wrap { width:min(1200px,calc(100% - 24px)); margin:0 auto; padding:88px 0 32px; }
    .maint-card { background:rgba(15,12,26,.92); border:1px solid rgba(139,92,246,.18); border-radius:8px; box-shadow:0 12px 32px rgba(0,0,0,.32); }
    .maint-hero { padding:20px; margin-bottom:16px; }
    .maint-eyebrow { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; min-height:32px; padding:0 12px; border-radius:8px; background:rgba(34,211,238,.12); border:1px solid rgba(34,211,238,.28); color:#22d3ee; font:700 .82rem/1 'Chakra Petch',sans-serif; letter-spacing:.08em; text-transform:uppercase; }
    .maint-eyebrow::before { content:""; width:8px; height:8px; border-radius:999px; background:currentColor; }
    .maint-title { margin:12px 0 8px; font-family:'Joystix',sans-serif; font-size:clamp(1.45rem,3vw,2.4rem); color:#fff; line-height:1.15; }
    .maint-copy { max-width:78ch; color:#c7c2df; font:500 1.08rem/1.68 'Chakra Petch',sans-serif; }
    .maint-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:16px; margin-bottom:16px; }
    .maint-stat { padding:16px; }
    .maint-stat-label { color:#8f8aa7; font:800 .82rem/1 'Chakra Petch',sans-serif; letter-spacing:.08em; text-transform:uppercase; }
    .maint-stat-value { margin-top:10px; color:#fff; font:800 2rem/1 'Chakra Petch',sans-serif; }
    .maint-stat-note { margin-top:8px; color:#a9a3c3; font:600 .92rem/1.5 'Chakra Petch',sans-serif; }
    .maint-panels { display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.15fr) minmax(0,.85fr); gap:16px; align-items:start; }
    .maint-panel { padding:16px; }
    .maint-panel-title { color:#fff; font:800 1.22rem/1.2 'Chakra Petch',sans-serif; }
    .maint-panel-copy { margin-top:8px; color:#a9a3c3; font:600 .98rem/1.6 'Chakra Petch',sans-serif; }
    .maint-actions { display:grid; gap:10px; margin-top:16px; }
    .maint-action { display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto; gap:12px; align-items:center; padding:14px; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08); border-radius:8px; background:rgba(255,255,255,.035); }
    .maint-action-title { color:#fff; font:800 1rem/1.2 'Chakra Petch',sans-serif; }
    .maint-action-note { margin-top:4px; color:#a9a3c3; font:600 .9rem/1.5 'Chakra Petch',sans-serif; }
    .maint-button-row { display:flex; gap:8px; flex-wrap:wrap; margin-top:16px; }
    .maint-button { min-height:40px; padding:0 14px; border-radius:8px; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1); background:rgba(255,255,255,.05); color:#fff; font:800 .9rem/1 'Chakra Petch',sans-serif; letter-spacing:.04em; cursor:pointer; transition:border-color .18s ease,background .18s ease,transform .18s ease; }
    .maint-button:hover { border-color:rgba(34,211,238,.35); background:rgba(34,211,238,.1); transform:translateY(-1px); }
    .maint-button.is-danger:hover { border-color:rgba(248,113,113,.35); background:rgba(248,113,113,.1); }
    .maint-status { min-height:22px; margin:14px 0 0; color:#22d3ee; font:800 .92rem/1.4 'Chakra Petch',sans-serif; letter-spacing:.04em; opacity:0; transform:translateY(-4px); transition:opacity .18s ease,transform .18s ease; }
    .maint-status.is-visible { opacity:1; transform:translateY(0); }
    .maint-key-list { display:grid; gap:10px; margin-top:16px; }
    .maint-key { padding:12px 14px; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08); border-radius:8px; background:rgba(255,255,255,.03); }
    .maint-key-head { display:flex; align-items:flex-start; justify-content:space-between; gap:12px; }
    .maint-key-name { color:#fff; font:800 .95rem/1.35 'Chakra Petch',sans-serif; word-break:break-word; }
    .maint-key-badge { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; min-height:28px; padding:0 10px; border-radius:999px; border:1px solid rgba(139,92,246,.22); background:rgba(139,92,246,.12); color:#c4b5fd; font:800 .78rem/1 'Chakra Petch',sans-serif; letter-spacing:.05em; white-space:nowrap; }
    .maint-key-preview { margin-top:8px; color:#a9a3c3; font:600 .88rem/1.55 'Chakra Petch',sans-serif; word-break:break-word; }
    .maint-empty { display:none; margin-top:16px; padding:16px; border:1px dashed rgba(255,255,255,.12); border-radius:8px; color:#8f8aa7; font:700 .95rem/1.6 'Chakra Petch',sans-serif; }
    .maint-note { margin-top:16px; color:#8f8aa7; font:600 .92rem/1.6 'Chakra Petch',sans-serif; }
    @media (max-width:1024px) {
      .maint-grid { grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); }
      .maint-panels { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
    }
    @media (max-width:720px) {
      .maint-wrap { padding-top:72px; }
      .maint-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
      .maint-action { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
    }
  </style>
  <style set:html={ADMIN_NAV_CSS}></style>
</head>
<body class="text-slate-200 maint-shell">
  <main class="maint-wrap">
    <Fragment set:html={adminNav} />

    <section class="maint-card maint-hero">
      <span class="maint-eyebrow">Admin maintenance</span>
      <h1 class="maint-title">Stockage navigateur et remise à zéro locale</h1>
      <p class="maint-copy">
        Cette page sert à diagnostiquer et purger les données front du site public via un bridge local.
        Ici, on parle du vrai <code>localStorage</code> et du <code>sessionStorage</code> de ManabuPlay en port <code>4321</code>,
        pas d’un profil Playwright isolé ni du stockage propre au dashboard.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="maint-grid" aria-label="Résumé maintenance">
      <article class="maint-card maint-stat">
        <div class="maint-stat-label">Origine</div>
        <div class="maint-stat-value" id="maint-origin-count">-</div>
        <div class="maint-stat-note" id="maint-origin-note">http://localhost:4321</div>
      </article>
      <article class="maint-card maint-stat">
        <div class="maint-stat-label">Clés ManabuPlay</div>
        <div class="maint-stat-value" id="maint-manabu-count">0</div>
        <div class="maint-stat-note">Toutes les clés <code>mp_*</code> détectées sur le site public ciblé.</div>
      </article>
      <article class="maint-card maint-stat">
        <div class="maint-stat-label">Records Libre</div>
        <div class="maint-stat-value" id="maint-best-count">0</div>
        <div class="maint-stat-note">Clés <code>mp_best_*</code> par difficulté.</div>
      </article>
      <article class="maint-card maint-stat">
        <div class="maint-stat-label">Sessions Libre</div>
        <div class="maint-stat-value" id="maint-practice-count">0</div>
        <div class="maint-stat-note">Historique du cooldown de 2 sessions.</div>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section class="maint-panels">
      <article class="maint-card maint-panel" id="maint-panel">
        <h2 class="maint-panel-title">Actions ciblées</h2>
        <p class="maint-panel-copy">
          On garde des boutons précis pour éviter d’effacer trop large par réflexe. La purge globale reste disponible en dernier.
        </p>

        <div class="maint-actions">
          <div class="maint-action">
            <div>
              <div class="maint-action-title">Effacer les records quiz</div>
              <div class="maint-action-note">Supprime uniquement les meilleurs scores du Libre, par difficulté.</div>
            </div>
            <button class="maint-button" type="button" data-maint-action="clear-best">Effacer les records</button>
          </div>

          <div class="maint-action">
            <div>
              <div class="maint-action-title">Effacer les sessions Libre</div>
              <div class="maint-action-note">Remet le cooldown du Libre à zéro en supprimant l’historique des sessions jouées.</div>
            </div>
            <button class="maint-button" type="button" data-maint-action="clear-practice">Effacer les sessions</button>
          </div>

          <div class="maint-action">
            <div>
              <div class="maint-action-title">Effacer la waitlist locale</div>
              <div class="maint-action-note">Supprime les emails locaux et l’état “déjà inscrit” du CTA newsletter.</div>
            </div>
            <button class="maint-button" type="button" data-maint-action="clear-waitlist">Effacer la waitlist</button>
          </div>

          <div class="maint-action">
            <div>
              <div class="maint-action-title">Réinitialiser la langue locale</div>
              <div class="maint-action-note">Supprime la préférence de langue stockée côté site public.</div>
            </div>
            <button class="maint-button" type="button" data-maint-action="clear-lang">Réinitialiser la langue</button>
          </div>

          <div class="maint-action">
            <div>
              <div class="maint-action-title">Purge ManabuPlay complète</div>
              <div class="maint-action-note">Supprime toutes les clés <code>mp_*</code> du <code>localStorage</code> et vide le <code>sessionStorage</code>.</div>
            </div>
            <button class="maint-button is-danger" type="button" data-maint-action="clear-all">Purge complète</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="maint-button-row">
          <button class="maint-button" type="button" id="maint-refresh">Rafraîchir l’état</button>
        </div>

        <div class="maint-status" id="maint-status" aria-live="polite"></div>
        <p class="maint-note">
          Important : ce panneau agit sur le site public ciblé par le bridge local.
          <code>localhost</code> et <code>127.0.0.1</code> restent deux stockages différents, même avec le dashboard séparé.
        </p>
      </article>

      <aside class="maint-card maint-panel">
        <h2 class="maint-panel-title">Clés détectées</h2>
        <p class="maint-panel-copy">
          Aperçu rapide des clés front actuellement présentes sur le site public ciblé, pour voir immédiatement ce qui traîne.
        </p>
        <div class="maint-empty" id="maint-empty">Aucune clé <code>mp_*</code> détectée dans le <code>localStorage</code> du site public ciblé.</div>
        <div class="maint-key-list" id="maint-key-list"></div>
      </aside>
    </section>
  </main>

  <script type="module" is:inline src="/scripts/admin-maintenance.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
